 "Each tree shows all bit sequences the algorithm can consume from a given \
starting state.  ",
 StyleBox["Blue",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.22, 0.42, 0.7]],
 " = root / internal bit-choice node.  ",
 StyleBox["Green",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0.8, 0.]],
 " outcome = moved to a new state.  ",
 StyleBox["Orange",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.9, 0.45, 0.]],
 " outcome = stayed.  Edge labels are bit values (0/1).  Hover over an \
outcome node to see the exact path weight."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d0e99b06-be2d-469f-8abd-a54b9dced02a"],

