Cell["Numerical MCMC Validation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d6e000a1-6418-4071-8990-5bb4dfef9df8"],

Cell["\<\
The algorithm is run as a live Markov chain with genuinely random bits.  \
Simulated state frequencies are compared to the analytical Boltzmann \
distribution Exp[\[Minus]\[Beta]E(s)] / Z.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"167842fb-bea7-4767-b8c1-eb8a1226f2f5"],

